{"sha": "a314958f854f9ba00fe280f6048dbd6c3a542a25a73a9e5c7a501565ff0d5839", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:dispersion-wave-packets} 章 --- 色散与波包}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:1}", "(a) $k = \\qty{0.063}{rad/m}$, $\\omega = \\sqrt{gk} = \\qty{0.79}{rad/s}$, $T = \\qty{8.0}{s}$;", "$v_\\varphi = \\qty{12.5}{m/s}$, $v_g = \\qty{6.3}{m/s}$. (b) $\\omega = \\qty{0.45}{rad/s}$, $k = \\omega^2", "/g = \\qty{0.021}{rad/m}$, $\\lambda = \\qty{310}{m}$; $v_\\varphi = gT/2\\pi = \\qty{22}{m/s}$, $v_g =", "\\qty{11}{m/s}$；$5 \\times 10^6/11 = \\qty{4.6e5}{s} = 5.3$ 天。(c) $\\lambda = \\qty{6}{m}$，$v_g", "= \\qty{1.6}{m/s}$：需耗时五周，而短波早在此之前", "就已被黏性衰减，并被风打散。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:2}", "$\\omega = \\qty{1.26e8}{rad/s}$, $\\omega_c = \\qty{6.3e7}{rad/s}$: $k = \\sqrt{\\omega^2 - \\omega_c^2}/c =", "\\qty{0.36}{rad/m}$, $v_\\varphi = \\qty{3.5e8}{m/s}$, $v_g = c^2k/\\omega = \\qty{2.6e8}{m/s}$,", "二者之积为 $c^2$。在 \\qty{5}{MHz} 时，$\\omega < \\omega_c$：$\\kappa = \\sqrt{\\omega_c^2 - \\omega^2}/c =", "\\qty{0.18}{m^{-1}}$，深度为 \\qty{5.5}{m}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:3}", "拍频为 \\qty{4}{Hz}，响度周期为 \\qty{0.25}{s}。水波：$f = 0.125$ 和", "\\qty{0.119}{Hz}；包络为 $\\cos(\\delta\\omega t - \\delta kx)$，取 $\\delta k = \\qty{2.9e-3}{rad/m}$", "（相邻拍相距 \\qty{1.1}{km}），速率为 $\\delta\\omega/\\delta k = \\qty{6.4}{m/s}$ ---", "即 \\qty{105}{m} 处的群速度，$\\tfrac12\\sqrt{g\\lambda/2\\pi} = \\qty{6.4}{m/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:4}", "$\\ln(b/a) = 1.20$: $\\Lambda = \\qty{0.24}{\\micro H/m}$, $\\Gamma = \\qty{106}{pF/m}$, $c = 1/", "\\sqrt{\\Lambda\\Gamma} = \\qty{2.0e8}{m/s}$, $Z_c = \\qty{48}{\\ohm}$, \\qty{5.0}{ns/m}; \\qty{10}{ns}", "$\\leftrightarrow$ \\qty{2.0}{m}。空气中：$\\Gamma = \\qty{46}{pF/m}$，$c = c_0$，$Z_c = \\qty{72}{\\ohm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:5}", "(a) $\\omega^2 = c^2k^2 + (EI/\\mu)k^4$; $v_\\varphi = \\sqrt{c^2 + (EI/\\mu)k^2}$; $v_g = (c^2k +", "2(EI/\\mu)k^3)/\\omega$. (b) $c^2 = \\qty{1.12e5}{m^2/s^2}$, $k = \\qty{66}{rad/m}$, $(EI/\\mu)k^2", "= \\qty{7.0e3}{m^2/s^2}$：$v_\\varphi/c = \\sqrt{1.063} = 1.031$，$+3.1\\%$ --- 即", "\\cref{ch:b2:waves-on-strings} 中的 $53$ 音分。(c) $v_g > v_\\varphi$：反常的；高次", "谐波跑在前面，拨弦的起音转为一段短促的", "下降啁啾。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:6}", "(a) $-\\mu\\omega^2 + \\iu\\alpha\\omega = -Tk^2$: $\\underline k^2 = (\\omega^2/c^2)(1 - \\iu\\alpha/\\mu\\omega)$.", "(b) $\\underline k \\approx (\\omega/c)(1 - \\iu\\alpha/2\\mu\\omega)$: $k' = \\omega/c$, $k'' = \\alpha/2\\mu c =", "\\alpha/2Z$; $8.7k''$ dB/m. (c) $c = \\qty{100}{m/s}$, $Z = \\qty{0.5}{kg/s}$, $\\mu\\omega = 3.1 \\gg", "0.02$：$k'' = \\qty{0.02}{m^{-1}}$，$\\delta = \\qty{50}{m}$，\\qty{0.17}{dB/m}。(d) 此时不属于该", "极限（$k' = \\omega/c$）；当 $\\alpha \\gtrsim \\mu\\omega$ 时，平方根不再", "线性化，且 $k'$ 对 $\\omega$ 呈非线性依赖：色散的（即", "电缆的扩散极限）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:7}", "(a) $v_\\varphi = \\sqrt{\\gamma k/\\rho}$，$v_g = \\tfrac32v_\\varphi$：群超过", "波峰。(b) $v_\\varphi^2 = g/k + \\gamma k/\\rho$ 在 $k_m = \\sqrt{\\rho g/\\gamma}$ 处取极小值：", "$\\lambda_m = 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\gamma/\\rho g} = \\qty{1.7}{cm}$, $v_{\\min} = (4g\\gamma/\\rho)^{1/4} =", "\\qty{23}{cm/s}$。(c) 尾迹是相对于", "船静止的图样，由相速度与船速相同的波构成；其中没有一个", "慢于 \\qty{23}{cm/s}。(d) 毛细区，$v_g > v_\\varphi$：波峰在", "环的前沿生成，在后沿消失。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:8}", "(a) $k = \\qty{0.126}{rad/m}$, $\\omega'' = -\\tfrac14\\sqrt{g/k^3} = \\qty{-18}{m^2/s}$: $t_{\\text{sp}}", "= 2.5 \\times 10^5/18 = \\qty{1.4e4}{s}$，四小时。(b) \\qty{10}{ps}：$t_{\\text{sp}} =", "4 \\times 10^{-6}/0.16 = \\qty{25}{\\micro s}$，\\qty{5}{km}，取 \\qty{2e8}{m/s}；\\qty{1}{ns}：$0.04/0.16 =", "\\qty{0.25}{s}$，\\qty{50000}{km}。短脉冲（高比特率）在", "数公里之内便展宽：长距离链路使用补偿光纤，或采用中等速率。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:9}", "(a) $\\partial_x^2v = R\\Gamma\\,\\partial_tv$, $D = 1/R\\Gamma = \\qty{1.1e12}{m^2/s}$. (b) $\\underline k^2", "= -\\iu R\\Gamma\\omega$: $k' = k'' = \\sqrt{R\\Gamma\\omega/2}$; \\qty{1}{Hz}: $k = \\qty{1.7e-6}{m^{-1}}$,", "$v_\\varphi = \\qty{3.7e6}{m/s}$, $\\delta = \\qty{600}{km}$; \\qty{10}{Hz}: $v_\\varphi = \\qty{1.2e7}{m/s}$,", "$\\delta = \\qty{190}{km}$. (c) $R\\Gamma L^2 = 9 \\times 10^{-13} \\times 9 \\times 10^{12} = \\qty{8}{s}$", "每点：约每分钟一个字。(d) $\\Lambda = R\\Gamma/G = \\qty{9}{H/km}$ --- 一个", "荒谬的电感（对海底电缆而言）；加感线圈曾用于陆地", "电话线路，其 $G$ 与 $R\\Gamma$ 不同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:10}", "(a) $\\partial_te = \\dot y(\\mu\\ddot y + Ky) + Ty'\\dot y' = \\dot yTy'' + Ty'\\dot y' = \\partial_x", "(Ty'\\dot y) = -\\partial_x\\mathcal P$. (b) $\\langle e\\rangle = \\tfrac14A^2(\\mu\\omega^2 + Tk^2 + K) =", "\\tfrac12\\mu\\omega^2A^2$（利用 $\\mu\\omega^2 = Tk^2 + K$）；$\\langle\\mathcal P\\rangle = \\tfrac12Tk\\omega", "A^2$。(c) 比值 $Tk/\\mu\\omega = c^2k/\\omega = v_g$。(d) $y = A\\eu^{-\\kappa x}\\cos\\omega t$：", "$\\mathcal P \\propto \\sin2\\omega t$，平均值为零 --- 没有能量穿过介质。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:11}", "(a) $\\tanh kh \\to 1$：$\\omega^2 = gk$；$kh \\ll 1$：$\\omega = \\sqrt{gh}\\,k$，速率为 $\\sqrt{gh}$，", "非色散的。(b) $kh = 0.13$：浅水；$c = \\sqrt{9.81 \\times 4000} = \\qty{198}{m/s}$，", "$T = \\qty{17}{min}$；\\qty{8000}{km}，用时 \\qty{11}{h}。(c) $\\tfrac12\\rho gA^2 = \\qty{1.2}{kJ/m^2}$", "在 $200 \\times 1000$ km$^2$ 范围内：\\qty{2.5e14}{J}。格林：$A \\propto h^{-1/4}$，$(4000/10)^{1/4}", "= 4.5$：\\qty{2.2}{m}，陡化与爬高之前。(d) 在 $h \\approx \\lambda/2 =", "\\qty{50}{m}$；位于较浅水域中的波峰部分减速，因此", "波峰转向，与等深线平行 --- 即折射。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:12}", "(a) 在 $x = \\ell$ 处：$v = v_i + v_r$，$i = (v_i - v_r)/Z_c$，$v = R_Li$：$r = (R_L -", "Z_c)/(R_L + Z_c)$。(b) $0$，$-1$，$+1$，$0.5$。(c) 线路的输入端看上去像", "$Z_c$，因此示波器在 $t = 0$ 时读到 \\qty{0.5}{V}，随后回波 $0.5r$ V 在", "$2\\ell/c = \\qty{1}{\\micro s}$ 时刻分别为：无、\\qty{-0.5}{V}、\\qty{+0.5}{V}、\\qty{+0.25}{V}；", "匹配的信号源吸收了回波，因此不会有第二个回波。(d)", "$\\tfrac12 \\times 2 \\times 10^8 \\times 1.8 \\times 10^{-6} = \\qty{180}{m}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:dispersion-wave-packets:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\partial_xv = -\\Lambda\\partial_ti - Ri$，$\\partial_xi = -\\Gamma\\partial_tv$；设", "$\\eu^{\\iu(\\omega t - kx)}$：$\\iu kv = (\\iu\\omega\\Lambda + R)i$，$\\iu ki = \\iu\\omega\\Gamma v$，由此", "$k^2 = \\omega\\Gamma(\\omega\\Lambda - \\iu R)$.", ""]}